-`count=0, camera_state=0, is_move=0, freq=19200, pending_notify=0, elevator_mode=0, (u16)stop/abort_flag=0, up_down_flag=0, (u64)move_count/sub_phase=0, time=all_time(2839), is_in_cali=0, up_down_count=0, key_idle=1`。
